* ResourceARN: (Required) ARN of the ElastiCache cluster or replication group.
* SnapshotRetentionPeriod: (Required) Minimum snapshot retention period in days.
* AutomationAssumeRole: (Required) The ARN of the role that allows Automation to perform the actions on your behalf.
