## What does this document do?
Enables AutoMinorVersionUpgrade on an Amazon RDS DB instance using the
[ModifyDBInstance](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonRDS/latest/APIReference/API_ModifyDBInstance.html) API.
When the instance belongs to a Multi-AZ cluster (mysql/postgres), the setting is applied on the cluster
via [ModifyDBCluster](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonRDS/latest/APIReference/API_ModifyDBCluster.html).

When invoked with Rollback=ROLLBACK, it restores AutoMinorVersionUpgrade to its pre-remediation
state using a snapshot stored in S3.

## Input Parameters
* AutomationAssumeRole: (Required) The ARN of the role that allows Automation to perform the actions on your behalf.
* RDSInstanceARN: (Required) ARN of the Amazon RDS DB instance.
* Rollback: (Optional) Set to ROLLBACK to execute rollback instead of remediation.
* ExecutionId: (Optional) Original SSM Automation execution ID for snapshot lookup during rollback.
* ControlExecutionId: (Optional) Level 1 (control runbook) execution ID, used as S3 snapshot key during remediation.
* SnapshotVersionId: (Optional) S3 version ID of the snapshot object, used for tamper-proof reads during rollback.
* RemediationConfigBucket: (Optional) S3 bucket name for snapshot storage.

## Output Parameters
* SnapshotRemediateOrRollback.snapshotStored
* SnapshotRemediateOrRollback.rollbackDescription
* SnapshotRemediateOrRollback.snapshotVersionId
* SnapshotRemediateOrRollback.Message
* SnapshotRemediateOrRollback.Status
",
          "mainSteps": [
            {
              "action": "aws:executeScript",
              "description": "## SnapshotRemediateOrRollback
Captures the pre-remediation AutoMinorVersionUpgrade state to S3, then enables it (on the Multi-AZ
cluster when applicable, else the instance). When Rollback=ROLLBACK, restores the pre-remediation
state from the snapshot.
",
              "inputs": {
                "Handler": "handler",
                "InputPayload": {
                  "AccountId": "{{ global:ACCOUNT_ID }}",
                  "AutomationExecutionId": "{{ ControlExecutionId }}",
                  "ExecutionId": "{{ ExecutionId }}",
                  "RDSInstanceARN": "{{ RDSInstanceARN }}",
                  "RemediationConfigBucket": "{{ RemediationConfigBucket }}",
                  "Rollback": "{{ Rollback }}",
                  "SnapshotVersionId": "{{ SnapshotVersionId }}",
                },
